From f1b9445b2ce5bca7553e19659e435033b3933829 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:44:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Games] Let the mouse play a mouse in a controller port

Some systems take their mouse in a controller port, such as the
PlayStation Mouse. Kodi only gave a game the mouse through a mouse port,
so with the PlayStation Mouse chosen for a port the mouse went to Kodi
instead, and moving or clicking it opened the in-game menu.

When a game has no mouse port, the mouse now plays the first controller
port with a controller that has a pointer, sending its input to that
port. It is opened again when the port, its controller or the mouse
changes.
